    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100403/1011004030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "監督",
    "text": "ははは！　大丈夫だよ\r\nそんなに心配しなくても～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "監督",
    "text": "甘酸っぱい感じの、いい映像になったよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "監督",
    "text": "やっぱり樹里ちゃんみたく、\r\nキラキラしたアイドルはこういうの、似合うよね～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
